## Recent Incidents

### Incident INC-2026-0105-A

On January 5, 2026, **Incident INC-2026-0105-A** was triggered by the Payment Gateway due to a certificate expiration. This incident affected the Order Processing Service and caused order failures for approximately 45 minutes. The Platform Engineering Team resolved the incident by renewing the SSL certificate.

### Incident INC-2026-0105-B

On January 5, 2026, **Incident INC-2026-0105-B** was triggered by the Inventory Database due to connection pool exhaustion. This incident affected the Order Processing Service and the Customer Portal. The Database Administration Team resolved the incident by increasing the connection pool size.

