## Team Responsibilities

- **Platform Engineering Team** manages the Payment Gateway and core platform infrastructure
- **Security Team** manages the Authentication Service and security policies
- **Database Administration Team** manages the Inventory Database and User Database
- **Data Science Team** manages the Machine Learning Platform and ML models
- **Frontend Team** manages the Customer Portal and user experience
- **Integrations Team** manages the Banking API and external service connections

